From: Folia Compatibility Patch
Subject: [PATCH] SpawnBlocksEffect: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater with native Folia schedulers

AE PATCH REASON: SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater makes code incompatible with Folia region-threaded architecture and crashes at runtime (UnsupportedOperationException from stripped SchedulerUtils or direct Bukkit.getScheduler() call rejected by Folia).
AE PATCH FIX: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater with native Bukkit.getRegionScheduler().runDelayed. Convert instanceof check to pattern matching. Rename obfuscated vars.
AE PATCH RISK: LOW - MIGRATE: SchedulerUtils → RegionScheduler. RF: pattern matching, var rename. No behavior change.

